  abstract = {Proposes a Zigbee-based edge gateway architecture for smart grid monitoring with 80 sensor nodes. Achieves low-latency data aggregation (320 ms end-to-end) and 99.4\% availability through multi-hop mesh topology with local edge processing. TCO analysis not reported.}
}

